{"4764090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Universe X", "steam_appid": 4764090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a fleet, grow your business, watch NPCs fight each other, and earn money for you or you go yourself to fight, trade, mine... Trade to earn money, discover secrets, upgrade or buy new ships to fill up your space garage from fighters all the way up to motherships. Walk inside the interior of the ship and talk to NPCs. Much more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/extras/8a2200bf874867b2eead50be3703a061.poster.avif?t=1782562778\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/extras/8a2200bf874867b2eead50be3703a061.webm?t=1782562778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/extras/8a2200bf874867b2eead50be3703a061.mp4?t=1782562778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing Business</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piloting fighters all the way to huge capital ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading weapons and ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fleet creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... MORE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system will evolve over time, NPCs have their own schedules sometimes, and you have to watch out as well for the attacks from big enemy ships; they are like small boss fights.<br><br>You have to create an infinitely big fleet to conquer enemy bases and ships, which earns you even more credits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is full of secrets, and exploration is advised if you want to make the most money and understand the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of the pilot seat and into your ship’s interior—walk around, tune in to galactic news, uncover hidden mysteries, and relax between battles.<br>Trade rare resources, grow your fortune, and shape your story among the stars.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a fleet, grow your business, watch NPCs fight each other, and earn money for you or you go yourself to fight, trade, mine... Trade to earn money, discover secrets, upgrade or buy new ships to fill up your space garage from fighters all the way up to motherships. Walk inside the interior of the ship and talk to NPCs. Much more... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/extras/8a2200bf874867b2eead50be3703a061.poster.avif?t=1782562778\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/extras/8a2200bf874867b2eead50be3703a061.webm?t=1782562778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/extras/8a2200bf874867b2eead50be3703a061.mp4?t=1782562778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing Business</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piloting fighters all the way to huge capital ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading weapons and ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fleet creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... MORE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system will evolve over time, NPCs have their own schedules sometimes, and you have to watch out as well for the attacks from big enemy ships; they are like small boss fights.<br><br>You have to create an infinitely big fleet to conquer enemy bases and ships, which earns you even more credits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is full of secrets, and exploration is advised if you want to make the most money and understand the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of the pilot seat and into your ship’s interior—walk around, tune in to galactic news, uncover hidden mysteries, and relax between battles.<br>Trade rare resources, grow your fortune, and shape your story among the stars.</p>", "short_description": "A sci-fi RPG strategy game where you build fleet, attack, trade and explore space. You can fight yourself, have others help you and upgrade your ship or buy plethora of ships for your space garage.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/25d3a029b7cdcf599db0940207b3e028bc191e72/header.jpg?t=1782562778", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/1a381cb5476ccceed96c72dd5407752f90e868e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782562778", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764090/1a